// RULE: GC-04 — a literal in an undeclared currency has no lowering.
// WHY IT MATTERS: the currency index defaulted to 0, so the literal entered the circuit
// denominated in whichever currency sorts first. The typechecker's NL0241 said the currency
// was unknown; the circuit went on holding a number in a real one.
// EXPECT: NL0506
// STAGE: lower
view large_postings = postings.where(|p| p.amt > 100.00 xbt)
    serve { consistency: snapshot, materialize: auto };
